config BR2_PACKAGE_HEXA_TASKMGR
	bool "hexa-taskmgr"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_LIBGTK3
	help
	  The hexaOS Task Manager: the open apps and the running programs
	  (grouped by name) with their CPU and memory use (end them from
	  here), live graphs of CPU, memory, disk and network use, and the
	  system services (start, stop, restart). Opens with Ctrl+Shift+Esc.
	  The Apps tab needs Weston patch 0008 (the shell's window list).
